              highlighted: ["D","F","A","K"] },
            { text: "Again, since the numbers {D} and {F} multiplied by {H} make {K} and {L} respectively,",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["D","F","H","K","L"] },
            { text: "therefore {D} is to {F} as {K} is to {L}.",
