            { text: "But {D} is to {F} as {A} is to {K}, therefore {A} is to {K} as {K} is to {L}.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","K","L"] },
            { text: "Further, since {F} multiplied by the numbers {H} and {G} makes {L} and {B} respectively,",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["F","H","G","L","B"] },
            { text: "therefore {H} is to {G} as {L} is to {B}.",
              visible: ALL,
