            { text: "But it was also proved that {D} is to {F} as {A} is to {K} and as {K} is to {L},",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["D","F","A","K","L"] },
            { text: "therefore {A} is to {K} as {K} is to {L} and as {L} is to {B}.",
