              highlighted: ["A","K","L","B"] },
            { text: "Therefore {A}, {K}, {L}, and {B} are in continued proportion.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","K","L","B"] },
            { text: "Therefore, as many numbers as fall between each of the numbers {A} and {B}",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","B"] },
            { text: "and the unit {C} in continued proportion,",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["C","D","E","A","F","G","B"] },
            { text: "so many also fall between {A} and {B} in continued proportion.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","K","L","B"] },
            { text: "Therefore, if numbers fall between two numbers and a unit in continued proportion,",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["C","D","E","F","G","A","B"] },
            { text: "then however many numbers fall between each of them and a unit in continued proportion,",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["D","E","F","G"] },
